  "kind": "recipe",
  "metadata": {
    "alignment": "unspecified",
    "description": "r0b0tlab's dual-GB10 vLLM serve of Poolside Laguna M.1 NVFP4 (225B total, 23B active, coding model): tensor parallel 2 over Ray (a single Spark runs out of memory during MoE init), FlashInfer-CUTLASS NVFP4 GEMM and MoE, nvfp4 KV cache, Poolside tool and reasoning parsers, eager execution. Upstream quick start: 8192 token context, 4 sequences, 0.82 memory utilization; it reports 11.4 tok/s at c=1 and 49 tok/s at c=8 with the nvfp4 KV cache (upstream claims, not measured here). Licences: model Apache-2.0 per its Hugging Face card; the upstream repository declares no licence file (information only).",
